{'symbol': 'NXPI', 'date': '2019-10-20 22:30:00', 'title': 'NXP SEMICONDUCTORS N.V. AND SIVERS IMA HOLDING AB COLLABORATE ON 5G', 'text': "NXP SEMICONDUCTORS N.V. AND SIVERS IMA HOLDING AB ANNOUNCED A COLLABORATION TO DELIVER FOR 5G-NR (NEW RADIO), SUCH AS GIGABIT FIXED WIRELESS ACCESS APPLICATIONS. THE AGREEMENT IS AN ECOSYSTEM RELATIONSHIP AROUND NXP'S HIGHLY FLEXIBLE LAYERSCAPE PROGRAMMABLE BASEBAND PLATFORM AND SIVERS IMA'S 5G-NR CHIP AND PHASED-ARRAY ANTENNA. BOTH PARTIES WILL CONTRIBUTE TO SECURE A HIGH-LEVEL OF INTEGRATION BETWEEN NXP BASEBAND AND THE SIVERS IMA 28 GHZ AND 60 GHZ RFICS AND PHASED-ARRAY ANTENNAS. SIVERS IMA AND NXP SOLUTION IS A PERFECT MATCH USING SIVERS IMA ZERO-IF ARCHITECTURE THAT OFFERS LESS CURRENT CONSUMPTION AND LOWEST COST, DUE TO THE NEED OF FEWER COMPONENTS. THE NXP LAYERSCAPE ACCESS PORTFOLIO OF PROGRAMMABLE BASEBAND PROCESSORS DELIVERS UNPRECEDENTED CONTROL OVER THE 5G-NR SOFTWARE IN ORDER TO SUPPORT NEW O-RAN COMPLIANT OPTIONS. TOGETHER WITH NXP LAYERSCAPE MULTI-CORE ARM SOCS AND THE EDGEVERSE SECURE SOFTWARE FRAMEWORK 5G INFRASTRUCTURE CUSTOMERS CAN DEPLOY A WIDE VARIETY OF 5GACCESS EDGE SYSTEMS."}{'symbol': 'NXPI', 'date': '2019-10-20 22:30:00', 'title': 'NXP SEMICONDUCTORS N.V. AND SIVERS IMA HOLDING AB COLLABORATE ON 5G', 'text': "NXP SEMICONDUCTORS N.V. AND SIVERS IMA HOLDING AB ANNOUNCED A COLLABORATION TO DELIVER FOR 5G-NR (NEW RADIO), SUCH AS GIGABIT FIXED WIRELESS ACCESS APPLICATIONS. THE AGREEMENT IS AN ECOSYSTEM RELATIONSHIP AROUND NXP'S HIGHLY FLEXIBLE LAYERSCAPE PROGRAMMABLE BASEBAND PLATFORM AND SIVERS IMA'S 5G-NR CHIP AND PHASED-ARRAY ANTENNA. BOTH PARTIES WILL CONTRIBUTE TO SECURE A HIGH-LEVEL OF INTEGRATION BETWEEN NXP BASEBAND AND THE SIVERS IMA 28 GHZ AND 60 GHZ RFICS AND PHASED-ARRAY ANTENNAS. SIVERS IMA AND NXP SOLUTION IS A PERFECT MATCH USING SIVERS IMA ZERO-IF ARCHITECTURE THAT OFFERS LESS CURRENT CONSUMPTION AND LOWEST COST, DUE TO THE NEED OF FEWER COMPONENTS. THE NXP LAYERSCAPE ACCESS PORTFOLIO OF PROGR